OL,3,AVenezuela signs military deal with US
OL,4,Aless than a year after Maduro's removal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe United States and Venezuela have
OL,7,Fre-established military ties less than
OL,8,Fa year after US forces seized the
OL,9,Fthen-leader of the South American
OL,10,Fcountry, Nicolas Maduro, in a raid on
OL,11,Fthe capital, Caracas.
OL,13,FThe interim government led by Delcy
OL,14,FRodriguez, Maduro's former
OL,15,Fvice-president, signed a military
OL,16,Fco-operation agreement with US
OL,17,FSecretary of Defence Pete Hegseth on
OL,18,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
